! Placement step 5 — witness and canon

The placement witness now reads the projector, CLI ingress/carry, and legacy control-door sites. It fails if residency decisions return to title patterns; `tools/witness-all.sh` includes it, and the CI rest cell invokes the witness collection. `CLAUDE.md` keeps the projection adapter paragraph thin. Disk-projection, sensorium-runbook, and kahua-memory-stage canon were edited and normalized with the built CLI.

Validation: `node tools/placement-residency-witness.mjs` passed. `node tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs` passed (3,874 files; all ceilings held). `git diff --check` passed. The node full suite completed with 82 failed files, 468 passed; 221 failed tests, 3,234 passed, 59 skipped, and one unhandled error. Founding/face failures primarily report `secret-home-unavailable`, because sealed-rest enrollment and the founding/admission custody sweep remain unwired. Full suites/build-stamp/typecheck across all five touched packages are not complete, so step 5 and the overall leap are not verified as landed.

Proposed commit subject: `lar:///ha.ka.ba/placement/witnesses-the-residency-law`

